\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces State organization of LIF (left) and SPRiF (right). LIF integrates input and reset in the same membrane variable. SPRiF separates spectral memory, governed by $A(\alpha ,\rho ,\omega )$ and $B$, from the auxiliary filter and membrane dynamics. The spectral state supplies the drive for firing, while the spike-triggered reset acts on the membrane.}}{3}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:organization}{{1}{3}{State organization of LIF (left) and SPRiF (right). LIF integrates input and reset in the same membrane variable. SPRiF separates spectral memory, governed by $A(\alpha ,\rho ,\omega )$ and $B$, from the auxiliary filter and membrane dynamics. The spectral state supplies the drive for firing, while the spike-triggered reset acts on the membrane}{figure.1}{}}
