\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces SPRiF states before and after a recorded spike on PS-MNIST. The upper panel shows the real and two oscillatory memory coordinates, vertically offset for visibility. The middle panel shows relative membrane voltage, and the lower panel shows the spike train. The vertical dashed line marks the reference spike at relative step zero. The aligned traces show how firing and membrane reset relate to the continuing evolution of the internal memory states.}}{9}{figure.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:mechanism}{{3}{9}{SPRiF states before and after a recorded spike on PS-MNIST. The upper panel shows the real and two oscillatory memory coordinates, vertically offset for visibility. The middle panel shows relative membrane voltage, and the lower panel shows the spike train. The vertical dashed line marks the reference spike at relative step zero. The aligned traces show how firing and membrane reset relate to the continuing evolution of the internal memory states}{figure.3}{}}
